<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379">        'You can address your spawn by its name the following way: &lt;code&gt;Game.spawns[</span><span style="--shiki-light:#0184BC;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2">\\'</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379">Spawn1</span><span style="--shiki-light:#0184BC;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2">\\'</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379">]&lt;/code&gt;.'</span><span style="--shiki-light:#0184BC;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF">:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379"> '您可以使用您 spawn 的名字来获取到它，就像这样：&lt;code&gt;Game.spawns[</span><span style="--shiki-light:#0184BC;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2">\\'</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379">Spawn1</span><span style="--shiki-light:#0184BC;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2">\\'</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379">]&lt;/code&gt;。'</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF">,</span></span>
